# Dredger's Insight: "When this enchantment enters, mill four cards. You may put an artifact, creature, or land card from
# among the milled cards into your hand." The four milled are Llanowar Elves, Lightning Bolt, Island and Sol Ring (Forest,
# the eighth card, is Bot1's turn-3 draw). Lightning Bolt is not an artifact, creature or land card, so it cannot be
# taken; Bot1 takes the creature, which leaves the graveyard - and "whenever one or more artifact and/or creature cards
# leave your graveyard" gains 1 life (the enchantment is on the battlefield by then).

